OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain on Wednesday,
OL,7,Fturning drier later. Bright spells and
OL,8,Fscattered showers on Thursday and
OL,9,FFriday.
